            <div xml:id="d704">

                <pb facs="0762" n="752" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg752"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/3–2349: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-03-30T19:00:00-05:00">March 30, 1949—7
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>410. Emb authorized reply Premier’s request (Embtel 629, Mar 23) in sense first
                    two substantive paras Embtel 637 Mar 23. Regarding proposals last two paras, no
                    encouragement should be given Chinese such use remaining ECA funds if
                    reauthorized by Congress.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
